			]
		},
		{
			"id": "t2CqpDR_kZr0NIHgI",
			"name": "Sniper's Eye",
			"reference": "B51",
			"local_notes": "A trained Acute Vision +1, kept separate from Occulobe's own bonus since this represents marksmanship training rather than physiology.\n\nLore: Scouts serve as a Chapter's snipers and infiltrators long before they're trusted with a Tactical squad's firepower, and that role is trained hard from day one.\n\nDesign: A small trained visual-acuity bonus (B35-style pricing) representing marksmanship training rather than another organ. 5 points.",
			"base_points": 5
		}
	],
